  "sourceNote": "Auxiliary non-Schaefer physical structures for presentation. Basal ganglia/STN rendering now prefers the atlas-derived CIT168 deterministic mesh in src/data/brain-surface/cit168-subcortical-det25.surface.json; thalamus rendering prefers the coarse Harvard-Oxford mesh in src/data/brain-surface/harvard-oxford-thalamus.surface.json; limbic and fallback components remain approximate viewer-space anchors, not evidence that Schaefer200 covers these structures. Specialized atlas label references point to src/data/specialized-atlases/specialized-atlas-registry.seed.json.",
  "systems": [
    {
